Any material source change after the physical/review freeze invalidates this exact-head gate and requires rerunning the affected checks.

## L3 acceptance target

The first target-Windows / ordinary-Plus physical task is deliberately **non-reviewer** and read-only. The tracked fixture asks one fresh worker to answer a bounded general engineering reasoning question without web/apps/plugins/connectors/files or external actions.

Required evidence remains:

```text
exact clean source HEAD
 -> exactly one fresh Temporary Chat child
 -> exact running-extension byte attestation
 -> exactly one bound task delivery
 -> correlated COMPLETED WORKER_RESULT_V1
 -> durable result survives controller restart/readback
 -> no unintended second child or second Send
 -> post-action source/runtime provenance revalidation
```

## Preserved boundaries

- ordinary ChatGPT remains the only current general planner;
- Control Plane / WorkingState / Verification Kernel / Finish Gate remain project-owned authority;
- exactly six public tools remain unchanged;
- no generic scheduler/event bus;
- no same-task automatic parent wake/resampling;
- no nested/fan-out workers;
- no mutating child worker;
- no project/worktree/environment creation;
- existing accepted independent-review procedures remain intact until a separately proven generic reviewer-consumer migration is safe.

## Prior experimental work

PR #145 and PR #138 remain experiment evidence only and must not be merged as the generic runtime. Their useful fresh-chat/one-Send observations were adapted behind the generic delegation boundary; reviewer-specific experiment semantics were not carried into `WORKER_RESULT_V1`.

## Acceptance remaining

This PR remains Draft / not merge-ready. Remaining gates:

1. target-Windows ordinary-Plus physical L3 for the tracked non-reviewer task, including installed/runtime provenance and no duplicate child/Send;
2. freeze/re-resolve final BASE/HEAD after physical qualification;
3. mandatory fresh ordinary-ChatGPT exact-head semantic review under the BASE review policy;
4. address any surviving findings; any material source fix invalidates the prior exact-head review/physical gate as applicable;
5. final exact-head CI/security + physical evidence revalidation;
6. verify refs still match and merge.
